# Vehicle lookup ready for a provider key

Date: 2026-10-06

This marker means the adapter/configuration/CLI/customer-confirmation architecture is ready to receive a real Portugal-capable provider credential. It does not claim that any unconfigured provider works or that fitment is verified.

## Add a key

Copy `.env.example` to `.env`, add the provider key and any contract-specific base URL/paths, select it with `VEHICLE_PROVIDER`, and restart FastAPI.

Auto Ways accepts:

```text
AUTOWAYS_API_KEY=...
```

The legacy name `AUTOWAYS_API_TOKEN` is also accepted.

