- 76 Python/API/provider tests pass.
- 3 frontend tests pass.
- Next.js production build passes with 15 routes.
- Strapi production build passes.
- Strapi PostgreSQL content/security verifier passes.
- Plate API returns `WAITING_FOR_PROVIDER` and zero candidates with no credentials.
- VIN cascade runs vPIC first and preserves its BASIC partial result exactly.
- CLI outputs raw payload, normalized candidates, precision, engine fields, K-Type, HTTP result, cost and next action.
- One/multiple/partial/no-result paths are represented.
- Public browser bundle contains no FastAPI credentials.
- Protected BFF endpoint is 401 without an HTTP-only session and succeeds after local login.
- Public CMS product endpoint contains no admin email, password hash or token fields.
- Garage save-twice regression passes with and without VIN/plate identifiers.

## Safety boundary

A successful identity response or returned K-Type is not fitment evidence. Customer confirmation resolves identity ambiguity; a trusted FitmentProvider must separately establish compatibility.
